OL,3,GNEWSANew youth hubs will have mental
OL,4,Ahealth support
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people in Lancashire will benefit
OL,7,Ffrom two new Young Futures Hubs under
OL,8,Fplans to strengthen youth services
OL,9,Facross parts of England.
OL,11,FBlackpool and Lancashire County
OL,12,FCouncils have been selected as two of
OL,13,F25 areas to receive a share of #70m
OL,14,Fgovernment funding.
OL,16,FThe new centres will provide a range of
OL,17,Factivities for young people aged 10 to
OL,18,F18, with some support also being made
OL,19,Favailable for young adults until they
OL,20,Fare 25.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
