OL,3,GNEWSANew youth hubs will have mental
OL,4,Ahealth support
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's just an absolutely fantastic
OL,7,Fopportunity for Blackpool and our young
OL,8,Fpeople are really deserving of this
OL,9,Finvestment," said Blackpool Councillor
OL,10,FKath Benson, cabinet member for young
OL,11,Fpeople and aspiration.
